- [x] indentify installation instructions from local `.conda` package file
  -  `conda install <PATH_TO_PACKAGE>.conda` ([reference](https://www.anaconda.com/docs/getting-started/working-with-conda/packages/install-packages))
  -  in pixi, see [reference](https://pixi.sh/latest/reference/cli/pixi/global/install/)
  `pixi global install --path xxxx.conda`
  real install: https://pixi.sh/latest/integration/extensions/pixi_inject/
  `pixi global install pixi-inject`
  `pixi inject --environment default --package my-package-0.1.0-py313h8aa417a_0.conda`
- [x] testing creation anaconda channel (for publishing)
    - [conda tutorial](https://docs.conda.io/projects/conda/en/stable/user-guide/tasks/create-custom-channels.html)
    - https://docs.conda.io/projects/conda-build/en/latest/user-guide/tutorials/build-pkgs.html
    - https://www.anaconda.com/docs/tools/anaconda-org/maintainer-guide/getting-started
    ```bash
        conda install anaconda-client conda-build
        anaconda login
        anaconda upload </PATH/TO/PACKAGE_NAME>.tar.bz2
        anaconda upload </PATH/TO/PACKAGE_NAME>.conda
    ```
    - https://www.anaconda.com/docs/tools/anaconda-org/maintainer-guide/hosted-packages
